WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

02:02.345 --> 02:04.345
Shouldn't you be swamped by the project?

02:04.425 --> 02:06.305
How do you have time to come back
and space out here?

02:07.465 --> 02:09.744
I wasn't spacing out. I was thinking.

02:11.144 --> 02:13.305
I'm just organizing some materials.

02:13.385 --> 02:15.385
Celestial doesn't have a place
for me to work,

02:15.465 --> 02:16.785
so I came back to the office.

02:18.225 --> 02:20.705
-Looks like what they're saying is true.
-What's true?

02:23.705 --> 02:25.785
You and Yang Rui
made a huge fool of yourselves

02:25.865 --> 02:27.065
in front of the Celestial client.

02:27.145 --> 02:28.945
You threw away all the goodwill

02:29.025 --> 02:30.265
we built with the client
after they accepted the overall plan.

02:30.865 --> 02:32.065
Now they won't even give you
a workstation.

02:32.825 --> 02:34.425
Don't talk nonsense!

02:46.505 --> 02:48.105
Who told you that?
Don't go spreading that around.

02:48.705 --> 02:50.265
I'm just giving you a heads-up.

02:50.345 --> 02:52.545
You've been in the spotlight too much.

02:52.625 --> 02:54.545
A lot of people at the company
are waiting to see you fall.

02:58.145 --> 03:01.025
Just now at the meeting,
someone told Sha Sha you're too arrogant.

03:01.665 --> 03:04.505
They said you argued with Tianna
in front of the client at Celestial.

03:04.585 --> 03:06.305
I didn't argue with her.

03:06.385 --> 03:08.105
I was just bickering with her.

03:08.185 --> 03:10.145
I know. But other people don't.

03:10.905 --> 03:11.905
So I'm just reminding you.

03:11.985 --> 03:13.025
One, tone it down.

03:13.105 --> 03:15.745
Two, if something
goes wrong with Yang Rui,

03:15.825 --> 03:16.785
don't take the fall for him.

03:17.585 --> 03:18.905
He doesn't listen to me at all.

03:19.505 --> 03:20.385
And he's my boyfriend.

03:20.465 --> 03:22.345
I can't go complain about him to Ma Ke.

03:24.985 --> 03:25.825
That's it then.

03:37.025 --> 03:38.945
You believe gossip like that?

03:39.025 --> 03:40.545
That's not like you.

03:41.225 --> 03:43.025
If you feel uncomfortable
being at the office alone,

03:43.105 --> 03:44.145
I'll come back
to keep you company next Monday.

03:44.225 --> 03:46.465
I don't need you to keep me company.

03:46.985 --> 03:49.345
I want to draft a new proposal
for their IT Department,

03:49.425 --> 03:51.705
so they can see
our sincerity and capability.

03:51.785 --> 03:54.465
At least so they don't think
Maxmise is all talk and no action.

03:54.545 --> 03:56.145
Ma Ke said to put it on hold.

03:56.225 --> 03:57.425
He'll handle it.

03:57.505 --> 03:59.065
Can you not go off on your own like this?

04:01.625 --> 04:03.905
Sorry. I sounded harsh just now.

04:03.985 --> 04:04.945
Don't take it to heart.

04:05.625 --> 04:07.745
I just think you shouldn't
keep butting heads with Ma Ke.

04:07.825 --> 04:09.145
-After all, last time--
-I know.

04:10.065 --> 04:10.905
Alright.

04:10.985 --> 04:12.785
Celestial is having a team-building event
this weekend, isn't it?

04:12.865 --> 04:14.745
We can go out together on our day off.

04:14.825 --> 04:15.665
How about Huanying World?

04:18.265 --> 04:19.985
Sure. We'll figure it out later.

04:32.265 --> 04:34.145
YE XINZHI

04:34.225 --> 04:35.985
Tonight at 8:30. J Center, 120th Floor.

04:36.785 --> 04:38.065
I'm meeting with the MD
of Morse Investment Bank

04:38.145 --> 04:39.865
to broker a deal for Tianhe Air.

04:39.945 --> 04:41.425
Can you come be my temporary secretary?

04:59.265 --> 05:00.385
Your first time here?

05:13.305 --> 05:14.465
Yeah.

05:15.065 --> 05:17.305
So I just took a bunch of photos
and posted them on Moments.

05:17.945 --> 05:19.225
Once you've been here a few dozen times,

05:19.305 --> 05:21.825
you'll only complain
about how long the elevator takes.

05:24.705 --> 05:26.465
But even then,

05:26.545 --> 05:29.545
face-to-face time
with Morse's MD is still rare.

05:35.385 --> 05:37.425
We're here to discuss
the Tianhe plan today.

05:37.505 --> 05:41.145
Isn't your outfit a bit too casual?

05:41.905 --> 05:43.145
I've known him for a long time.

05:43.225 --> 05:45.705
Dressing too formally
actually feels a bit odd.

05:50.105 --> 05:51.425
But what you're wearing is just right.

05:51.505 --> 05:52.345
Relax.

05:52.425 --> 05:53.945
Relax, and you'll be at your best.

05:59.265 --> 06:00.265
Relax.

06:00.345 --> 06:02.785
Don't forget how you bragged to Tianna.

06:02.865 --> 06:05.585
How come the moment you meet,
you're the only one freaking out?

06:05.665 --> 06:07.665
Thank you for the postcard you sent me.

06:08.185 --> 06:10.305
The small building in the picture
is exactly the same as I remember.

06:10.385 --> 06:12.185
-Happy?
-Yeah.

06:12.265 --> 06:13.425
Then I'm even happier.

06:23.905 --> 06:26.345
Foul. That's just foul.

06:29.985 --> 06:31.425
What would you two like to drink?

06:31.505 --> 06:32.585
-Jiwa.
-Jiwa, thanks.

06:34.185 --> 06:35.585
You two are so in sync.

06:36.545 --> 06:37.825
-I'll have an Americano.
-Sure, sir.

06:37.905 --> 06:39.105
-Mr. Deng.
-Mr. Ye.

06:39.185 --> 06:40.145
Let me introduce you.

06:40.225 --> 06:41.465
This is my assistant, Chi.

06:42.065 --> 06:43.545
-Hello. I'm Xu Chi.
-Hello.

07:06.305 --> 07:08.545
If this deal goes through,
I really have to thank you.

07:09.345 --> 07:10.505
Why be so formal with me?

07:10.585 --> 07:12.145
I happen to be consulting for Tianhe.

07:12.225 --> 07:13.905
I know they have investment needs,

07:13.985 --> 07:16.145
and I know you've got plenty of capital.

07:16.225 --> 07:17.385
It's just a small favor.

07:18.265 --> 07:21.025
Tianhe really hit the jackpot
hiring you as consultants.

07:21.985 --> 07:25.385
Miss Xu, please organize
the meeting minutes when you get back.

07:25.465 --> 07:27.465
Once I receive them tomorrow,
I'll reach out to them right away.

07:28.265 --> 07:29.225
Already sent to your email.

07:31.945 --> 07:33.265
I trained her personally.

07:33.345 --> 07:34.665
Very fast.

07:34.745 --> 07:36.225
And her accuracy is just as good.

07:37.065 --> 07:38.265
I'm not worried about that.

07:38.345 --> 07:39.385
Because just now,

07:39.465 --> 07:41.105
many of Miss Xu's points
really impressed me.

07:42.025 --> 07:44.545
Miss Xu, would you consider
joining my company?

07:47.825 --> 07:49.865
I've long heard that the chef
at Morse's Beijing headquarters

07:49.945 --> 07:54.305
elite staff restaurant
was hired from a top five-star hotel.

07:54.825 --> 07:57.265
If you'd like to take me along
for a good meal,

07:57.345 --> 07:58.185
I can leave right now.

07:58.785 --> 07:59.745
Let's go.

08:00.345 --> 08:02.465
Deng. Poaching in front of me, huh?

08:04.225 --> 08:05.945
Joking aside.

08:06.025 --> 08:09.025
You know, I really admire you guys.

08:09.105 --> 08:11.145
No matter what industry you consult for,

08:11.225 --> 08:12.705
you're always so professional.

08:12.785 --> 08:15.265
Consultants are supposed to know
the industry better than the clients.

08:15.865 --> 08:18.945
You can't just pull a random case
from the files and churn out a proposal.

08:19.465 --> 08:21.465
Fooling the client and fooling yourself?

08:21.985 --> 08:23.785
That's not how I do things.

08:23.865 --> 08:25.385
That's what makes you impressive.

08:25.905 --> 08:26.905
Maxmise isn't magic.

08:26.985 --> 08:28.985
How could we possibly know
every company's technical details?

08:29.065 --> 08:31.225
Just showing them a tiny bit
is more than enough.

08:31.305 --> 08:32.385
Let's wish us success.

08:32.465 --> 08:33.664
Success.

08:56.025 --> 08:57.985
You're not still thinking
about Celestial's IT Department, are you?

09:00.265 --> 09:01.225
No.

09:01.305 --> 09:02.865
I… I was moved by the movie.

09:05.425 --> 09:06.585
This is a comedy.

09:12.385 --> 09:15.385
Laughing through tears
is what makes it really touching.

09:18.185 --> 09:19.585
I'm going to the restroom.

09:38.705 --> 09:40.145
So embarrassing.

09:47.465 --> 09:48.545
Xu Chi.

09:49.865 --> 09:53.185
Lin? What a coincidence.
Are you here to see a movie too?

09:53.265 --> 09:54.705
I saw you earlier.

09:55.465 --> 09:57.065
I wanted to thank you
for helping me find that agent.

09:57.145 --> 09:59.985
I've finished moving,
and the divorce is done.

10:00.065 --> 10:01.345
I feel totally free.

10:01.425 --> 10:04.665
So I wanted to catch a few movies
before my leave ends, just to relax.

10:04.745 --> 10:05.945
That's great.

10:07.265 --> 10:09.665
I think I saw you
come in with Yang Rui earlier.

10:11.425 --> 10:12.505
Yeah.

10:12.585 --> 10:14.665
We haven't been together long.

10:17.025 --> 10:18.505
I thought I was seeing things.

10:18.585 --> 10:20.265
How did you end up with Yang Rui?

10:21.345 --> 10:22.305
Is there something wrong with him?

10:22.905 --> 10:24.305
No, that's not what I meant.

10:24.905 --> 10:26.865
He joined the company two years after me,

10:26.945 --> 10:28.465
but he's a good consultant.

10:28.545 --> 10:30.785
He's a decent guy with a good personality.

10:31.745 --> 10:32.665
Then why…?

10:33.785 --> 10:36.745
I just thought you and Ye Xinzhi
were pretty close before.

10:36.825 --> 10:38.785
I assumed you two…

10:38.865 --> 10:40.865
No, no. You've got it wrong.

10:42.905 --> 10:44.745
My family and he are friends.

10:49.665 --> 10:52.745
Actually, years ago,
Richard was my mentor.

10:53.265 --> 10:55.785
He really is charming.

10:55.865 --> 10:59.705
I even had a little crush on him once.

11:00.905 --> 11:03.825
But looking back now,
it was probably just admiration.

11:05.105 --> 11:06.905
I interned under him at Boen
for over half a year,

11:06.985 --> 11:09.025
so I know him very well.

11:09.105 --> 11:10.665
He's very cautious.

11:10.745 --> 11:12.065
So cautious that he'd never

11:12.145 --> 11:14.305
go to dinner alone
with a female colleague.

11:14.385 --> 11:16.905
So that night when I saw him drunk
and leaning on you,

11:16.985 --> 11:18.745
I got really angry.

11:19.265 --> 11:20.145
But that proved

11:20.225 --> 11:23.105
he'd already let you
into his inner circle.

11:24.185 --> 11:26.985
And I could tell
you have feelings for him.

11:27.625 --> 11:30.785
-Lin, I…
-You don't have to rush to deny it.

11:31.505 --> 11:35.225
The fact that I can say all this openly
shows I've long since let it go.

11:35.825 --> 11:38.785
His type is what young girls fall for.

11:38.865 --> 11:40.705
I'm way past liking that type now.

11:44.145 --> 11:45.185
You should get going.

11:45.265 --> 11:46.105
See you at the office.

11:53.785 --> 11:54.985
FISH SPINNERS

12:10.025 --> 12:11.345
Look at that.

12:19.985 --> 12:22.305
BEIJING HAPPY VALLEY

12:33.705 --> 12:38.585
LONG TIME NO SIP, TIPSY BAR

12:38.665 --> 12:40.705
-Let's buy some water.
-Sure.

12:43.025 --> 12:44.105
Here.

12:44.625 --> 12:45.985
This water is pretty expensive, isn't it?

12:47.465 --> 12:48.785
I grabbed the wrong one.

12:48.865 --> 12:49.705
Which one do you want?

12:51.225 --> 12:53.185
Hello. Two bottles of this, please.

12:53.265 --> 12:54.585
-That's 20 total.
-Okay.

12:55.185 --> 12:56.265
-Let me.
-I'll pay.

12:56.345 --> 12:57.185
Let me.

12:59.865 --> 13:01.465
Alright. Thanks.

13:03.025 --> 13:04.225
Thank you.

13:22.985 --> 13:23.825
Lin.

13:24.465 --> 13:25.785
Back then,

13:26.505 --> 13:30.145
how did you control your feelings for him?

13:31.785 --> 13:34.025
I left Boen and joined Maxmise.

13:38.305 --> 13:39.385
Yang Rui is my "Maxmise".

13:42.385 --> 13:43.465
I get it.

13:44.945 --> 13:46.025
I won't try to talk you out of it.

13:46.105 --> 13:47.385
After all, you know only

13:47.465 --> 13:49.425
if a relationship is worth it
once you've been in it.

13:50.025 --> 13:52.505
But as someone who's been divorced,
let me share one piece of experience.

13:52.585 --> 13:54.825
If you're with someone you like,

13:54.905 --> 13:55.985
no matter how busy or tired you are,

13:56.065 --> 13:57.625
you'll be happy.

13:58.145 --> 14:01.665
But if you're with someone
you don't like that much,

14:01.745 --> 14:04.465
you won't last long before you get tired.

14:06.505 --> 14:07.545
Yang Rui.

14:07.625 --> 14:08.985
-I--
-Let's break up.

14:12.905 --> 14:15.745
Actually, I've been wanting
to say this to you.

14:15.825 --> 14:17.625
I just didn't know how.

14:18.345 --> 14:21.585
Honestly, when we first got together,
I was really happy.

14:21.665 --> 14:25.905
But over time, I realized
there was no real spark between us.

14:27.625 --> 14:29.105
We're just not meant to be together.

14:29.945 --> 14:33.825
Because we're interested
in different things.

14:34.585 --> 14:37.145
And every time we go on a date,
we're not on the same page.

14:37.705 --> 14:40.785
We were always just trying it out anyway.

14:40.865 --> 14:43.345
But I figured if one day

14:43.425 --> 14:45.505
you dumped me first,
that'd be pretty embarrassing.

14:46.025 --> 14:47.785
So I might as well beat you to it.

14:51.945 --> 14:54.985
Where are your manners?
Whatever happened to "ladies first"?

14:56.705 --> 14:58.905
We're both corporate drones.
Let's not bother with gender.

15:01.065 --> 15:02.745
-We're still good colleagues.
-Of course.

15:03.865 --> 15:05.305
And friends.

15:06.865 --> 15:07.745
Good breakup.

15:07.825 --> 15:10.345
You and Yang Rui
never had any chemistry anyway.

15:10.425 --> 15:12.065
And you getting publicly criticized

15:12.145 --> 15:15.305
by Mr. Sun from Celestial's IT Department
was all thanks to him.

15:17.145 --> 15:19.665
We talked it over. Since we broke up,

15:19.745 --> 15:21.385
staying in the same project team
would be awkward,

15:21.465 --> 15:23.225
so I want to apply
for a transfer to another team.

15:23.305 --> 15:24.825
Come to our team.

15:24.905 --> 15:27.505
Let's really join forces
and do something big together.

15:27.585 --> 15:28.585
Sure.

15:29.225 --> 15:30.825
I think there's too much dust

15:30.905 --> 15:33.265
in your router, so it's overheating,
and the WiFi keeps dropping.

15:33.345 --> 15:34.785
Let me wipe it down. That should fix it.

15:36.465 --> 15:37.585
Now

15:38.905 --> 15:40.785
you've broken up with Yang Rui.

15:40.865 --> 15:41.985
You're single again.

15:42.065 --> 15:44.025
How are you moving things
forward with Ye Xinzhi?

15:44.625 --> 15:46.265
Move what forward?

15:46.345 --> 15:47.945
Just go back to how things were.

15:48.025 --> 15:50.745
Once you've had the best,
nobody else compares.

15:50.825 --> 15:51.985
Since I like him,

15:52.065 --> 15:54.385
I won't force myself
to be with someone else.

15:55.145 --> 15:56.345
I'm just not good enough
for him right now.

15:56.425 --> 15:58.025
Then I'll work for it.

15:58.105 --> 16:01.105
I'll learn from him
while keeping things flirtatious.

16:01.185 --> 16:02.545
Maybe one day I'll deserve him.

16:02.625 --> 16:04.785
Then I'll have both career and love.

16:06.305 --> 16:08.865
"Once you've had the best,
nobody else compares"?

16:09.905 --> 16:11.145
Have you even had him?

16:11.905 --> 16:13.265
Have you even been through anything?

16:13.345 --> 16:14.585
That's just a secret crush.

16:14.665 --> 16:16.145
Don't flatter yourself.

16:19.545 --> 16:20.785
Let me tell you,

16:20.865 --> 16:22.425
after we met with Mr. Deng
from Morse that day,

16:22.505 --> 16:25.065
Ye Xinzhi drove me back to the hotel.
He sat in the back seat with me.

16:25.145 --> 16:28.865
I have a feeling if he knew I broke up,
he'd be pretty happy.

16:29.825 --> 16:31.185
What are you laughing at?

16:31.745 --> 16:34.145
The two of you are worlds apart in status.

16:34.225 --> 16:35.625
He's way up there.

16:35.705 --> 16:37.345
Should he sit in the front
instead of the back?

16:37.425 --> 16:41.065
Besides, if some young girl were putting
herself on a silver platter for me,

16:41.145 --> 16:42.265
I'd be loving it too.

16:43.785 --> 16:44.745
I'm not fixing your router.

16:44.825 --> 16:46.305
Just leave it. Let the WiFi stay broken.

16:46.385 --> 16:48.505
-I'm done.
-Can't handle…

16:48.585 --> 16:50.065
Can't handle facing reality?

16:52.425 --> 16:55.585
Anyway, he's not the kind
of textbook scumbag you described.

16:56.105 --> 17:01.625
He hasn't made a move
because he has feelings for me,

17:01.705 --> 17:02.785
but he's just not in love with me yet.

17:02.865 --> 17:04.025
But just you wait.

17:04.105 --> 17:05.305
One day,

17:05.825 --> 17:08.585
I'll become a woman he can't resist.

17:18.345 --> 17:19.704
How exactly "can't resist" are we talking?

17:24.464 --> 17:28.385
Do you really want to know?

17:29.545 --> 17:30.625
Gross.

17:31.305 --> 17:33.665
You sure you don't want to know?

17:35.585 --> 17:37.065
I'm just wondering…

17:37.585 --> 17:39.625
What if you don't become that woman?

17:39.705 --> 17:43.105
And even if you do,
what if he won't commit to you?

17:46.745 --> 17:48.105
Don't blame me for raining on your parade.

17:48.185 --> 17:50.185
I looked it up. He's been divorced.

17:51.825 --> 17:53.025
He's been divorced!

17:53.105 --> 17:54.905
I know. I know. I looked it up too.

17:55.505 --> 17:57.465
Miss Bu, why are you such a pessimist?

17:57.545 --> 17:59.825
First of all, nothing's
even started between us yet.

17:59.905 --> 18:01.265
Why think about the ending?

18:01.345 --> 18:03.065
Second, in love,

18:03.145 --> 18:06.505
the dopamine only lasts
about three months on average.

18:06.585 --> 18:08.505
Maybe by then I'll be the one
who gets bored first.

18:09.225 --> 18:12.065
Then he's only good
for what I can learn from him.

18:12.145 --> 18:15.105
Once I've squeezed him dry,
it'll be my turn to…

18:22.705 --> 18:24.545
And how exactly are you going
to squeeze him dry?

18:26.625 --> 18:28.305
Bu Tianna.

18:28.385 --> 18:31.065
-Will you cut it out?
-Will you…

18:31.145 --> 18:32.105
What are you doing?

18:32.185 --> 18:33.025
Is this how you squeeze him?

18:33.105 --> 18:34.665
Bu Tianna, you… I'm going to hit you.

18:34.745 --> 18:35.705
Is this the squeeze?

18:35.785 --> 18:36.945
I…

18:37.025 --> 18:39.305
Help! Do you still want me
to fix your router or not?

18:39.385 --> 18:40.985
What are you doing?

18:41.065 --> 18:42.665
So you can make dirty jokes about me,
but I can't do that to you?

18:43.665 --> 18:44.865
You're no fun.

18:45.385 --> 18:46.505
Okay, fine.

18:46.585 --> 18:47.825
Then hire a repair guy to fix it.

18:47.905 --> 18:48.745
Don't ask me to do it.

18:48.825 --> 18:50.545
-Because you don't charge.
-Are you short on money?

18:50.625 --> 18:51.825
Yeah.

18:53.585 --> 18:55.945
I just don't want strange men in my place.

18:56.025 --> 18:59.865
And most people
who fix this stuff are men.

19:01.425 --> 19:02.945
But Zhao Heng
came by the other day, didn't he?

19:03.905 --> 19:06.505
Is he not a stranger, or not a man?

19:33.265 --> 19:34.105
‎He…

19:36.825 --> 19:39.065
Who is it? Who's there?

19:40.105 --> 19:40.985
Who is it?

19:42.905 --> 19:44.585
-It's me.
-What are you doing here?

19:44.665 --> 19:47.225
Didn't your WiFi go down?
And your computer too?

19:47.305 --> 19:48.425
Last time, I noticed

19:48.505 --> 19:50.345
the property management
gave you an old router.

19:50.425 --> 19:51.585
The signal's bad.

19:51.665 --> 19:52.505
This one's better.

19:52.585 --> 19:53.785
Did I ask you about the router?

19:53.865 --> 19:57.345
I asked why you came to my place
without my permission.

19:57.425 --> 19:58.625
Because of love.

20:02.345 --> 20:03.425
What's wrong?

20:03.945 --> 20:06.105
Who's there? Do you have someone over?

20:07.985 --> 20:09.625
Speak of the devil.

20:09.705 --> 20:11.985
Devil? Are you two talking about me?

20:12.065 --> 20:12.905
Putting on a show?

20:13.505 --> 20:14.585
Yeah.

20:14.665 --> 20:16.465
Fine. I already fixed it for you.

20:16.545 --> 20:17.625
I'm heading out.

20:18.225 --> 20:20.465
I'll leave you two to it,
whether it's just talking or full action.

20:20.545 --> 20:21.585
Either way.

20:21.665 --> 20:22.825
-I'm off.
-Wait.

20:23.425 --> 20:25.145
-I'm leaving with you.
-Where are you going?

20:25.225 --> 20:25.985
Home.

20:27.105 --> 20:27.945
Home?

20:28.025 --> 20:29.505
You're going home,
given how bad things are with your family?

20:29.585 --> 20:31.185
What do you mean, bad?

20:31.265 --> 20:33.865
I left quietly last time.

20:33.945 --> 20:35.065
I didn't burn any bridges.

20:35.145 --> 20:39.465
And I'm not going
to just follow their script.

20:39.545 --> 20:41.865
They're stringing me along.
I can string them along too.

20:41.945 --> 20:43.665
I'll play the loving daughter

20:43.745 --> 20:46.625
while slowly seizing control
of Siwei Group.

20:46.705 --> 20:47.825
Besides, Bu Tianjie is just a kid.

20:47.905 --> 20:49.865
By the time he's old enough to take over,

20:49.945 --> 20:52.425
who knows who Siwei Group will belong to.

20:52.505 --> 20:53.705
It'll belong to the Bu family.

20:55.945 --> 20:57.585
-Let's go.
-Wait.

20:57.665 --> 20:59.305
You still haven't said
how you're going to tell Ye Xinzhi

20:59.385 --> 21:00.465
you broke up.

21:01.265 --> 21:02.865
I've got an ace up my sleeve.

21:02.945 --> 21:04.465
Accidental run-ins work best.

21:08.385 --> 21:09.585
Why are you sitting down?

21:11.625 --> 21:12.905
And with your shoes on?

21:13.745 --> 21:15.265
Aren't I marrying into the family?

21:15.785 --> 21:18.425
From now on, just call me "Bu Shoes-On"!

21:27.945 --> 21:29.625
Alright. Your license plate
is restricted today.

21:29.705 --> 21:33.385
I promise I won't stay a minute longer
after dropping you off.

21:33.905 --> 21:36.345
Stop doubting fate
when it brings us together, will you?

21:39.505 --> 21:40.745
What fate?

21:41.425 --> 21:42.665
Don't flatter yourself.

21:43.185 --> 21:44.585
There is no fate between us.

21:45.545 --> 21:46.665
So cold-hearted.

21:48.745 --> 21:50.105
Zhao Heng, listen.

21:50.625 --> 21:53.785
Even if I used your shoulder once
when I was down, so what?

21:53.865 --> 21:55.985
We are never taking this any further.

21:56.745 --> 21:58.705
I never said
I needed us to take it further.

21:58.785 --> 22:01.265
I actually think
we're great just like this.

22:03.505 --> 22:05.705
Zhao Heng, I'm telling you this
for the very last time.

22:05.785 --> 22:07.585
Stop wasting your time on me.

22:07.665 --> 22:09.585
It's never going to happen between us.

22:09.665 --> 22:13.265
And I'll tell you this one last time too.

22:13.905 --> 22:15.105
Relationships take two people.

22:16.065 --> 22:17.545
It's not your decision alone to make.

22:19.225 --> 22:21.025
How can you be so thick-skinned?

22:21.105 --> 22:25.065
I made myself crystal clear,
and you're still clinging to me? Why?

22:25.145 --> 22:27.585
I don't even like you!

22:33.105 --> 22:35.705
I know every single trick
you scheming guys like to pull.

22:35.785 --> 22:38.185
You're just trying to take
advantage of my vulnerability.

22:38.265 --> 22:39.745
How would you know so well?

22:47.745 --> 22:49.225
Have you been burned
by a scheming guy before?

22:52.345 --> 22:56.825
You've got looks, talent,
and family background.

22:56.905 --> 22:59.265
But at your age,
you have zero interest in relationships.

23:00.225 --> 23:04.065
And you're completely on guard
whenever a man gets close.

23:04.865 --> 23:06.385
And when you saw
Xu Chi and Ye Xinzhi getting close,

23:06.465 --> 23:07.345
you kept warning her.

23:08.385 --> 23:12.065
I remember you always told us
your family favors boys over girls.

23:12.145 --> 23:13.345
But I've never heard you

23:13.425 --> 23:15.345
mention them pressuring you
to get married.

23:19.465 --> 23:20.425
I get it now.

23:21.665 --> 23:25.265
You must've been deeply hurt by a gentle,
mature, scheming guy.

23:25.345 --> 23:28.145
Hurt so bad that even your parents
don't dare bring it up.

23:28.225 --> 23:31.505
Hurt so bad
that you're once bitten, twice shy.

23:31.585 --> 23:33.225
What does the down payment
on your old house have to do with me?

23:33.825 --> 23:35.145
What right do you have
to have my jewelry appraised?

23:35.225 --> 23:37.145
Do you know that was a birthday gift
from my dad?

23:41.745 --> 23:42.705
Get lost.

23:44.465 --> 23:45.745
And he probably got close to you

23:45.825 --> 23:47.745
right around when you came back
from abroad and found out

23:47.825 --> 23:49.105
you had a little brother. Am I wrong?

23:49.185 --> 23:51.225
So you're really afraid of me
taking advantage of your vulnerability.

23:51.305 --> 23:52.145
Pull over.

23:52.225 --> 23:54.065
I don't have time for your stories.

23:54.785 --> 23:56.185
-I didn't even say anything…
-Are you pulling over or not?

23:56.265 --> 23:58.545
If you don't, I'll grab
the steering wheel right now,

23:58.625 --> 23:59.465
and we'll both go down together.

24:00.625 --> 24:02.945
You want to die with me? That works too.

24:04.105 --> 24:06.825
-One, two…
-How can you be so shameless?

24:06.905 --> 24:07.825
Didn't your mom teach you any manners?

24:17.625 --> 24:18.945
Say whatever you want about me.

24:19.025 --> 24:20.505
Just leave my parents out of this.

24:20.585 --> 24:22.745
It must take
a special kind of toxic parents

24:22.825 --> 24:25.545
-to raise someone as shameless as you.
-Apologize!

24:25.625 --> 24:26.945
Or I'll never talk to you again!

24:27.025 --> 24:27.865
You…

24:29.185 --> 24:30.225
You better mean it!

24:30.945 --> 24:31.785
I've got plenty of simps.

24:31.865 --> 24:33.545
One less won't matter.

24:48.705 --> 24:50.105
Miss, you're back.

25:18.585 --> 25:19.865
No, I'm not going!

25:19.945 --> 25:20.985
I'm not getting that shot!

25:21.505 --> 25:22.785
So noisy.

25:24.385 --> 25:26.305
-Xiaojie.
-What's all the racket?

25:26.385 --> 25:28.985
Bad guy! Let me go!

25:29.665 --> 25:32.665
Mrs. Bu told me to take Xiaojie
to get his vaccine before she left,

25:32.745 --> 25:34.025
but he just won't cooperate.

25:34.105 --> 25:36.545
-Xiaojie, be a good boy.
-No!

25:36.625 --> 25:38.105
Xiaojie, it really doesn't hurt.

25:38.185 --> 25:39.385
-Just go.
-Move.

25:39.465 --> 25:40.625
Get up!

25:41.705 --> 25:43.665
-Miss.
-Miss, you…

25:44.425 --> 25:45.945
Stay right there. Don't move!

25:46.545 --> 25:47.305
You two, step back.

25:48.345 --> 25:49.665
So you don't get hurt.

26:01.385 --> 26:03.345
-Are you going or not?
-No!

26:03.425 --> 26:05.505
I'm asking you one last time.
Going or not?

26:05.585 --> 26:07.905
Not a chance!

26:11.665 --> 26:12.625
Are you going or not?

26:13.265 --> 26:15.465
Yes. I'll go.

26:16.385 --> 26:17.865
There. Nice and easy.

26:46.225 --> 26:47.545
This is the place.

26:48.665 --> 26:50.585
Based on his habits,

26:50.665 --> 26:52.505
he should come at a fixed time every week.

27:17.505 --> 27:19.425
-Why is she here?
-No idea.

27:20.385 --> 27:22.705
Aren't you gonna go say hi?

27:24.105 --> 27:25.425
-Okay. Give me a sec.
-Alright.

27:43.465 --> 27:45.385
-What are you doing here?
-I should be asking you.

27:45.465 --> 27:47.145
What are you doing here?
I've always worked out here.

27:50.065 --> 27:52.785
I've been wanting
to try some equipment lately.

27:53.425 --> 27:56.225
I saw on WeChat
that they offer weekend trials.

27:56.305 --> 27:57.545
And it's close to my place.
Thought I'd check it out.

28:01.505 --> 28:02.625
Working hard, huh.

28:03.625 --> 28:04.585
It's Saturday.

28:05.225 --> 28:06.145
Not out having fun with friends?

28:18.545 --> 28:19.385
Um…

28:21.185 --> 28:22.385
I broke up.

28:32.385 --> 28:33.865
Really?

28:33.945 --> 28:35.025
Sorry to hear that.

28:37.785 --> 28:39.065
So,

28:40.345 --> 28:42.305
I just wanted to come sweat it out today.

28:45.345 --> 28:46.305
Yeah.

28:48.665 --> 28:50.025
Sweating it out is good.

28:50.545 --> 28:53.265
Sweat it all out and you forget
all your troubles.

28:53.785 --> 28:55.065
For you.

28:56.185 --> 28:58.465
I'm going boxing.

29:08.785 --> 29:09.905
Ran off.

29:11.025 --> 29:12.025
Go boxing?

29:12.665 --> 29:13.745
That's it?

29:26.305 --> 29:27.385
Can't look back.

29:32.665 --> 29:33.905
And I can't leave now either.

29:35.025 --> 29:36.905
If I leave, he'll definitely notice.

30:08.545 --> 30:11.865
PRIVATE, DO NOT ENTER

30:24.145 --> 30:25.865
What is it now?

30:30.865 --> 30:31.825
Coming.

30:36.305 --> 30:37.745
You tattled again?

30:39.465 --> 30:40.905
Tattled about what?

30:41.465 --> 30:45.225
I just got home
and saw him squirming by the car,

30:45.305 --> 30:46.305
refusing to get in.

30:46.385 --> 30:49.465
He said he'll only get the vaccine
if you take him.

30:50.185 --> 30:51.345
I'm not going.

30:51.425 --> 30:52.385
I'm busy.

30:53.345 --> 30:55.745
You're clearly not working right now.

30:55.825 --> 30:57.825
What's the big deal about
taking Xiaojie out?

30:57.905 --> 31:00.305
It's rare he's so attached to you.

31:00.905 --> 31:04.225
Your dad and I both want you two
to get along.

31:04.745 --> 31:06.425
Just go with him.

31:09.745 --> 31:11.665
You really want me to take you?

31:12.185 --> 31:13.465
Can I hit him if he doesn't behave?

31:13.545 --> 31:15.705
Of course. You're his sister.

31:16.865 --> 31:18.065
He's all yours.

31:20.505 --> 31:23.065
Just get along, you two. I'm off.

31:26.785 --> 31:27.785
Sit.

31:55.105 --> 31:56.465
What is wrong with you?

31:58.265 --> 31:59.425
Are you alright?

31:59.505 --> 32:01.185
I… I'm fine.

32:02.065 --> 32:03.705
It's okay. Don't be scared.

32:03.785 --> 32:05.745
I… I'm not scared.

32:06.865 --> 32:09.145
Oh my. Scared me to death.

32:12.465 --> 32:14.945
You really wanted me
to come with you that badly?

32:16.545 --> 32:17.625
Why?

32:18.665 --> 32:20.465
Because shots hurt.

32:20.545 --> 32:22.225
You broke wooden boards
and didn't feel a thing.

32:22.985 --> 32:26.345
I wanted to borrow some of your courage,

32:26.425 --> 32:27.505
so it won't hurt as much.

32:41.265 --> 32:42.265
Come on.

32:46.145 --> 32:47.225
She's gone.

32:47.305 --> 32:48.345
Your little girl's gone.

32:52.665 --> 32:54.185
She looked so down.
Aren't you gonna go after her?

32:54.785 --> 32:55.785
No.

32:56.625 --> 32:57.705
Let's keep training.

33:03.385 --> 33:05.385
Did you take some kind of power pill?
That hurt like crazy.

33:05.465 --> 33:06.985
You're off today.

33:07.065 --> 33:08.465
She leaves, and you take it out on me?

33:09.545 --> 33:10.625
Do you keep training or what?

33:11.385 --> 33:12.505
Let's… Let's take a break.

33:12.585 --> 33:13.745
My hand hurts.

33:14.865 --> 33:16.345
What did you two talk about?

33:20.465 --> 33:21.305
Nothing much.

33:22.225 --> 33:23.905
She just told me

33:25.705 --> 33:26.865
she broke up with her boyfriend.

33:29.305 --> 33:30.465
Well, that's great!

33:30.545 --> 33:32.025
That's good news.

33:32.105 --> 33:33.585
She's single,

33:33.665 --> 33:35.505
so she'll have more time for work, right?

33:35.585 --> 33:37.585
So that gives you an opening. Right?

33:40.665 --> 33:41.745
Wait, what opening?

33:42.345 --> 33:43.545
-Am I that kind of guy?
-Wait. What are you doing?

33:43.625 --> 33:47.825
-Hey, am I that kind of guy?
-What are you doing?

33:47.905 --> 33:49.345
W-What did I say? I…

33:49.425 --> 33:50.905
An opening. Like,

33:50.985 --> 33:53.825
more chances for you two
to work together. What?

33:53.905 --> 33:55.185
What were you thinking?

33:55.265 --> 33:56.545
What were you thinking?

33:56.625 --> 33:58.505
What were you thinking?
What were you thinking?

34:01.985 --> 34:04.585
Okay, stop. Let's get back to training.

34:05.105 --> 34:06.105
-Come on.
-Yeah.

34:06.185 --> 34:07.265
You really should work out more.

34:07.345 --> 34:08.905
Exercise keeps you young.

34:08.985 --> 34:12.465
That way, the age gap
between you and your little girl

34:12.545 --> 34:13.824
won't show as much.

34:15.744 --> 34:17.185
Do I look that old?

34:17.705 --> 34:18.865
See for yourself.

34:38.665 --> 34:39.905
-Don't move. Stay still.
-No!

34:39.985 --> 34:41.585
-Stay still. Hands down.
-I don't want it!

34:41.665 --> 34:42.985
Don't move.

34:43.065 --> 34:44.505
-Stay still!
-Trust me. It won't hurt at all.

34:44.585 --> 34:46.264
He's moving so much,
I can't give him the shot.

34:51.065 --> 34:52.065
Then…

34:56.145 --> 34:57.105
Just pretend.

34:57.185 --> 34:58.145
Don't actually stick me.

35:09.425 --> 35:11.705
Look at me. Watch closely.

35:28.945 --> 35:30.665
See that? Doesn't hurt at all.

35:32.905 --> 35:34.425
-Did you hear that?
-Yeah.

35:34.505 --> 35:35.985
Then let's do it.

35:56.945 --> 35:59.785
Tianna, did it hurt just now?

36:01.265 --> 36:02.945
I'm a karate expert.

36:03.025 --> 36:04.145
What's a little pain?

36:04.985 --> 36:05.985
Here. Have some candy.

36:08.025 --> 36:09.025
I don't like candy.

36:09.545 --> 36:10.385
You take it.

36:10.465 --> 36:14.065
Even if you're not afraid of pain,
shots still hurt.

36:14.145 --> 36:15.625
In cartoons,

36:15.705 --> 36:18.505
girls feel better after eating candy.

36:18.585 --> 36:19.945
Mom won't let me eat candy.

36:20.025 --> 36:21.745
She says it'll rot my teeth.

36:21.825 --> 36:24.425
I worked so hard to hide this one.

36:31.425 --> 36:32.585
What's so great about candy?

36:33.705 --> 36:34.785
You keep it.

37:00.625 --> 37:01.665
I'll take you for ice cream.

37:02.585 --> 37:03.625
Really?

37:03.705 --> 37:05.025
You're not lying to me?

37:05.545 --> 37:07.225
Ice cream! Ice cream!

37:07.785 --> 37:08.785
Stay still.

37:08.865 --> 37:10.665
If you move again, I won't take you.

37:12.785 --> 37:15.305
I also want donuts.

37:16.345 --> 37:17.665
And cotton candy.

37:18.385 --> 37:19.425
Tianna, you're my favorite.

37:19.505 --> 37:20.425
My favorite!

37:24.105 --> 37:25.065
Tianna.

37:26.025 --> 37:28.785
Will you be the CEO for me?

37:29.465 --> 37:31.465
I don't wanna be a CEO.

37:32.105 --> 37:37.025
Dad always says when I grow up,
I'll be the CEO.

37:37.105 --> 37:40.105
But I don't wanna be busy
like Dad every day.

37:40.825 --> 37:42.105
I just wanna play.

37:44.625 --> 37:45.665
Silly.

37:46.305 --> 37:47.505
When you grow up,
you won't think that way anymore.

38:11.545 --> 38:13.025
What's wrong?

38:14.865 --> 38:16.545
No luck with Ye the Legend either?

38:24.585 --> 38:30.065
I waited all afternoon
just to tell him I'm single now,

38:30.145 --> 38:34.385
and he just went, "Oh, really?

38:35.185 --> 38:36.505
Well, I'm going boxing."

38:39.025 --> 38:41.385
I bet you've never met anyone
as delusional as me.

38:42.145 --> 38:43.065
There's another one right here.

38:43.145 --> 38:44.745
Come on.

38:45.865 --> 38:48.625
Fellow losers in love. Come on, forget it.

39:10.745 --> 39:12.265
YE THE LEGEND

39:14.145 --> 39:15.305
I'm at a meeting by the lake tonight.

39:15.385 --> 39:16.665
The moonlight is beautiful.

39:16.745 --> 39:17.945
Just wanted to send it to you.

39:18.025 --> 39:19.345
Good night. Sleep well.

39:19.425 --> 39:21.145
THE MOONLIGHT IS BEAUTIFUL TONIGHT

39:21.745 --> 39:23.065
Scumbag.

39:23.705 --> 39:25.945
He ignores me,
then sends me stuff like this.

39:26.025 --> 39:26.865
What does he want?

39:31.065 --> 39:32.065
What's wrong?

39:40.905 --> 39:42.025
Are you okay?

39:42.545 --> 39:45.065
Here, drink this. Tomato juice.

39:46.585 --> 39:48.425
I'm fine. I'm not drunk.

39:48.505 --> 39:49.465
SONGFENG RESTAURANT

39:49.545 --> 39:51.025
Just drink it.

39:51.105 --> 39:52.625
Anyone who's drunk says they're not drunk.

39:52.705 --> 39:53.825
It's got fructose.

39:53.905 --> 39:55.545
It'll make your stomach feel better.

39:59.065 --> 40:00.145
Chi.

40:01.065 --> 40:03.505
How come I never noticed
how caring you are?

40:04.465 --> 40:05.545
Oh my God.

40:06.585 --> 40:07.665
I…

40:08.305 --> 40:10.865
I'm taking care of the guy
who's pursuing my best friend.

40:10.945 --> 40:12.985
Do you think I'm not acting
like enough of a pick-me?

40:16.145 --> 40:17.105
What are you doing?

40:17.185 --> 40:19.945
Let me run something by you, Chi.

40:20.025 --> 40:23.185
Actually, I've always thought
we'd be a good match.

40:24.185 --> 40:26.865
Look, you've got nothing going on.
I'm hopeless too.

40:26.945 --> 40:29.425
Let's just get together and piss them off.

40:30.465 --> 40:31.505
Go away.

40:37.825 --> 40:40.025
Just think about it.
Hey, let's talk about it.

40:40.785 --> 40:43.145
Go home and sober up.

40:43.665 --> 40:44.505
Come on.

40:45.025 --> 40:46.785
Go, go, go.

40:46.865 --> 40:47.745
Water.

40:49.225 --> 40:50.145
Easy.

40:52.545 --> 40:57.345
I hope you'll be a new man
in 32 hours, okay?

40:57.945 --> 40:59.105
How about this?

40:59.185 --> 41:00.505
Let's take a photo

41:01.025 --> 41:02.865
and post it on Moments.
Only they can see it.

41:02.945 --> 41:04.025
Piss them off.

41:04.105 --> 41:05.185
Get in the car.

41:05.265 --> 41:07.305
Just one photo.

41:07.385 --> 41:08.545
I'm closing the door.

41:09.545 --> 41:10.745
I'm leaving.

41:11.705 --> 41:12.745
Bye!

41:25.185 --> 41:26.745
Approved. Effective immediately,

41:26.825 --> 41:29.985
Xu Chi is transferred to the actuarial
team for the Celestial project.

41:30.065 --> 41:31.305
MA KE

41:31.385 --> 41:33.105
Back then,

41:33.185 --> 41:35.665
I suddenly remembered Su Su's WeChat bio.

41:36.185 --> 41:39.825
"Love comes and goes,
but work is forever."

41:40.945 --> 41:45.185
Tomorrow is always a new day.

41:58.745 --> 42:01.625
I need a performance measurement tool
for the Actuarial Department.

42:01.705 --> 42:02.625
Do you have one?

42:04.425 --> 42:07.625
Balanced Scorecard or KSF-based
total performance compensation?

42:07.705 --> 42:10.185
I've seen Lian'an Insurance's
in our files. Hold on.

42:12.985 --> 42:15.225
Lian'an uses BSC. I'll send it to you.

42:16.025 --> 42:19.105
I need the big data utilization rate
for Celestial's Actuarial Department.

42:19.185 --> 42:20.545
17.3%.

42:21.345 --> 42:23.105
You can check data table two.

42:23.185 --> 42:24.785
-It has more details.
-Okay.

42:26.865 --> 42:30.385
By the way, we have a video meeting
with external insurance data experts

42:30.465 --> 42:31.785
tomorrow at ten.

42:31.865 --> 42:34.945
Ma Ke said anyone who wants
to ask questions live is welcome to join.

42:35.025 --> 42:35.705
Are you guys going?

42:35.785 --> 42:36.745
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

42:57.345 --> 42:58.865
Oh my God.

42:58.945 --> 43:01.305
It's only eight in the morning
and there's already such a long line.

43:01.385 --> 43:04.025
This is the limited-edition black truffle
milk tea that's going viral right now.

43:04.105 --> 43:05.185
They only sell 200 cups a day.

43:05.265 --> 43:07.585
I heard every girl loves it.

43:07.665 --> 43:09.425
-Let's go line up. Go.
-Let's go.

43:14.785 --> 43:15.705
Which flavor are you getting?

43:15.785 --> 43:17.825
Black truffle, of course.

43:17.905 --> 43:19.225
That's what everyone's here for.

43:36.865 --> 43:38.025
Zhao Heng?

43:48.345 --> 43:49.505
You're not lining up?

43:49.585 --> 43:50.825
Someone bought it for me.

43:50.905 --> 43:51.985
Lucky you.

43:53.785 --> 43:55.025
Can you save me a spot?

44:02.945 --> 44:03.985
Take it.

44:04.865 --> 44:06.465
I don't like milk tea.

44:09.865 --> 44:12.545
Didn't you say
you'd never talk to me again?

44:13.145 --> 44:14.065
Then why did you…?
